  "briefing": {
    "title": "CONVERGENCE",
    "story": [
      "The towers sing. The Directorate remnant has answered the only way it knows:",
      "three uplink batteries on the northern flats, aimed at the towers, waiting for a",
      "fleet that will never come. Their fire control runs through your convergence node.",
      "",
      "SERA VANE: \"Every battery they raise is another thread cut. Take them offline —",
      "all three — or the continent finishes what the Vein started.\"",
      "",
      "MARSHAL CORR: \"Then we move. No more sitting on the defensive. The node holds; we go.\""
    ],
    "objectives": [
      "Destroy the three Directorate uplink batteries",
      "Protect the convergence node (defend the Radar)",
      "Vane must survive (O selects, F1/F2 cast)"
    ]
  },
  "debrief": {
    "win": [
      "The batteries fall silent. The last Directorate command on Aether Prime is a",
      "single fortified crater above the Vein, and every gun it has left is pointed at you.",
      "",
      "VANE: \"One door left. Whatever is behind it, we open it together.\""
    ],
    "lose": [
      "The batteries fire until the towers crack. The convergence node collapses,",
      "the threads go slack, and Aether Prime wakes into nothing at all."
    ]
  },
