      },
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "message",
          "speaker": "MARSHAL CORR",
          "text": "Those installations predate every map we own. The planet built its own garrison. Burn them out, Warden — the convergence node cannot fall."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "t_first_down",
      "when": {
        "objectiveComplete": "obj_inst_north"
      },
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "message",
          "speaker": "MARSHAL CORR",
          "text": "North installation is slag. Its guns were aimed at the towers — the planet's own reflexes are fighting the cure."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "t_second_down",
      "when": {
        "objectiveComplete": "obj_inst_east"
      },
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "message",
          "speaker": "SERA VANE",
          "text": "East battery dark. The Chorus isn't angry, Corr. It's afraid. I know the difference now."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "t_third_down",
      "when": {
        "objectiveComplete": "obj_inst_south"
      },
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "message",
          "speaker": "THE CHORUS",
          "text": "...the reflex dies... and we let it die... this is what trust costs"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "t_node_pressure",
      "when": {
        "timeSeconds": 240
      },
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "message",
          "speaker": "MARSHAL CORR",
          "text": "Movement converging on the node from the deep tunnels. Whatever you're holding back — stop holding it back."
